00:02:56,460 --> 00:02:58,945
And this continues to occur over

50
00:02:58,945 --> 00:03:01,430
a period of some time, whether

51
00:03:01,430 --> 00:03:03,915
it may be minutes, hours, days,

52
00:03:03,915 --> 00:03:07,643
even sometimes weeks and even years in certain markets.

53
00:03:07,645 --> 00:03:12,790
Now, note, this can occur across all time frame participants and all time frames.

54
00:03:12,790 --> 00:03:15,104
So, it's not just exclusive to

55
00:03:15,104 --> 00:03:17,418
