164
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:31,695
So, you get the early part of a trend, which is the trendsetters.

165
00:10:31,695 --> 00:10:37,185
And this is the phase where, effectively, a new piece of information is in the market.

166
00:10:37,185 --> 00:10:38,432
You know, participants want

167
00:10:38,432 --> 00:10:40,927
