00:14:19,595 --> 00:14:22,788
it, think of it as almost like a gravitational, you know, pull.

233
00:14:22,790 --> 00:14:24,997
And, you know, as we're moving more

234
00:14:24,997 --> 00:14:27,204
and more away from it, either the

235
00:14:27,204 --> 00:14:29,095
market's going to accept that, you

236
00:14:29,095 --> 00:14:32,878
know, now we're going to start repricing or accepting value somewhere else,

237
00:14:32,880 --> 00:14:35,273
or if we fail and there's not enough

238
00:14:35,273 --> 00:14:37,367
force and not enough initiative, we're going

239
00:14:37,367 --> 00:14:39,461
to very quickly snap back, almost like

240
00:14:39,461 --> 00:14:44,248
an elastic would snap if you were, you know, if you were trying to shoot it.

