00:24:44,710 --> 00:24:49,100
So, this continues to occur over a period of time.

411
00:24:49,100 --> 00:24:52,120
So, what I want to point out and illustrate to

412
00:24:52,120 --> 00:24:54,536
you is that trade location, and we're going

413
00:24:54,536 --> 00:24:59,368
to talk a lot about trade location in the coming slides, trade location defines our risk.

414
00:24:59,370 --> 00:25:01,948
In other words, what I mean by that,

415
00:25:01,948 --> 00:25:04,204
if we are looking for buy side

416
00:25:04,204 --> 00:25:07,749
trades in that first box, for instance, in the first bracketing,

417
00:25:07,750 --> 00:25:14,410
if we're looking for buy side trades towards the high momentum trades, we're taking on a lot more risk.

418
00:25:14,410 --> 00:25:19,335
Equally, if we're looking for sell side trades towards the bottom of it, we are taking on high risk.

419
00:25:19,335 --> 00:25:23,760
However, once we break and show the force behind the

420
00:25:23,760 --> 00:25:27,300
selling and the initiative, then there's a high

421
00:25:27,300 --> 00:25:32,168
probability opportunity to look for momentum plays or trending type plays.

422
00:25:32,170 --> 00:25:34,135
So, just note the crucial difference there.

423
00:25:34,135 --> 00:25:38,791
It's okay to interpret a market being sideways and having a potential

